    "detailed_description": "&quot;Skufs and Alt-girls&quot; is a tamagotchi game in which you have to try on the role of a girl assistant and take care of after a man.<br><br>Ah, have you not heard about this new profession? In short, the Ministry of Social Development has developed a program to support single men over forty years who have not been realized in life. They were called Skufs. It took a lot of girls to implement the program and their task was to help those men.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2>- 5 playable characters, which means 5 stories!<br>- Tamagotchi mechanics: take care of the scoof and put it in order.<br>- Lots of exciting mini-games, like tanks! Well, what kind of game about Scythians without tanks?<br>- built-in Internet;<br>- stock exchange;<br>- vampire like about Rus and Lizards;<br>- references to memes;<br>- and much, much more!",
